1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
कम fluency score = semantic memory कमजोर?

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,000
ज़रूरी नहीं। Task समझिए।

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Semantic memory: facts, concepts और meanings

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,200
Category fluency: एक minute में examples

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,000
Word count, order और clustering

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Fluency सिर्फ knowledge नहीं।

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Search strategy भी असर डालती है।

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,100
Processing speed और language production

9
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:27,200
Executive control और instructions

10
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,300
Word count pure knowledge meter नहीं।

11
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:33,100
Naming और definition matching अलग हैं।

12
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:36,300
Factual accuracy item पर निर्भर।

13
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,300
Wording, language और familiarity भी।

14
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:42,500
Feeling-of-knowing subjective report है।

15
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:45,500
Confidence correctness की guarantee नहीं।

16
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,500
ERP task-related neural correlate है।

17
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,300
Direct knowledge readout नहीं।

18
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:54,500
Computational model theory या estimate है।

19
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,600
दिमाग का पूरा map नहीं।

20
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:01,500
Measure पहचानिए; एक score से intelligence या cognitive health तय मत कीजिए।

21
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:05,600
यह diagnosis नहीं है और personal, medical, या financial advice नहीं है। AI narration और conceptual visuals उपयोग हुए हैं।
